        "## Classical Baseline: OCR + Regex\n",
        "\n",
        "Purpose  \n",
        "Provide a non-deep learning floor using Tesseract OCR and pattern extraction. Which is generally adequate for `total` and `date` when legible; weak for `company` and `address` where layout cues matter.\n",
